<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Nov yr/yr inflation 2.3 pct vs Oct 2.1.</title>
<headline>Austria Nov yr/yr inflation 2.3 pct vs Oct 2.1.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	  November    October	 Nov 95</p>
<p> Month/month change	     0.1	 -0.2	    -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	     2.3	  2.1	     1.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    131.3	131.2	   128.4</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
